###
# @name RegisterUser
# 用户注册请求
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "vscode_tester",
    "full_name": "VSCode测试员",
    "email": "vscode@example.com",
    "phone_number": "15800002222",
    "password": "securepass",
    "user_type": "courier"
}

### 分隔符，用于区分不同的请求

###
# @name LoginUser
# 用户登录请求 (使用用户名)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "vscode_tester",
    "password": "securepass"
}

###

###
# @name LoginUserWithWrongPassword
# 使用错误密码登录
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "vscode_tester",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}